\] 
These functors, being left adjoints in ${\mathscr{M}\!on\mathscr{C\!A\!T}_{\mathrm{lax}}}$, are in fact strong monoidal 
\cite{Kelly:doctrinal}.
Theories are mapped as follows, as noted in Section~\ref{subsec:enrichment}:
\[
